{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "0e04b2f8f1a6a3ad37f302f0260e1500c47cf85656fecafd36d591c40e125302", "ja": "6th Track　魅せつけて", "zh": "Track 6　展现魅力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4e011ee8a8582aa39cd5e1657ed0f0a93055dc63e3552c8b7769ad721c1b40ed", "ja": "初ライブ当日。コンビニに買い出しに行った\n亜利沙は、対バン相手の自分達への陰口を聞\nいてしまう。話を聞いて落ち込む恵美と可奈\nに、お客さんは期待していると言うプロデュ\nーサー。3人は気合いを入れ直した！", "zh": "首次演出的当天。去便利店采购的\n亚利沙，听到了对手组合在背后说\n她们的坏话。制作人对听后情绪低落的惠美和可奈\n说，观众们都在期待着她们。3人重新打起了精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4", "ja": "ライブ当日……", "zh": "演出当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e8d16873319a3aee89039b4e0203982ee86b5af333925335270e7315d5687ef", "ja": "おお……ここが、アタシたちの出演する\nライブハウスかぁ……。", "zh": "哦哦……这里就是我们要出演的Live House啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "4c4dfb651823b21d299a5beba61fe437c1ce9e79b0c3f289ba9556b5bd4273f4", "ja": "私、ライブハウスに入ったの、\n初めてかもしれません……！", "zh": "我好像是第一次进Live House呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "287fcf721e5588314dbd684d3bfaeff04074c5dcedb84c89d03eea82c0215606", "ja": "ありさは、地下アイドルちゃんのライブで\n来たことがありますけど……。", "zh": "亚利沙虽然为了看地下偶像的演出\n来过这里就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "81d6ed76cf18699743fcd464a6c6e4fed9d45adbc961f65ec1b6b08d940c163e", "ja": "バンドとしてって、き、緊張しますね。ありさ、\nもうお水のペットボトル飲みきっちゃいました……！", "zh": "作为乐队登台，确、确实让人紧张呢。人家已经把整瓶水都喝光了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "66292480efd958c9231612c8cee44924819ebb25c49b58dfb248b06f39d5b399", "ja": "ライブハウスの前に、コンビニあったよね？\nアタシも欲しいものあるし、ちょっと行ってくるよ。", "zh": "演出场前面有便利店吧？\n我也有想买的东西，先去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "45685ae9b39fb71f6d84bafec1ecc8b8f90f1641c70a769d653e5573b1166f9f", "ja": "なら、ありさが行ってきます！\nありさはもう、準備終わってますし。", "zh": "那就由亚利沙去吧！\n亚利沙已经准备好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1ab023b8abf9bd38678f4ed2230faea0f6ca92728f0380896ecd61f6e3e8c9e2", "ja": "俺も行くよ。まだ開演には早いけど、\n万が一出待ちのファンがいたら困るしな。", "zh": "我也去。虽然离开演还早，\n但万一有等着见我们的粉丝就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "59a483c57d6394cb656b133acb932fc82391e3cad4395e31d836ae886a519aeb", "ja": "えっと、スポーツドリンクと、のどあめと……\n買い忘れはありませんね♪", "zh": "那个，运动饮料、润喉糖，还有……\n应该没有忘记买什么吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "060cf0aec45988a4411fe2e824387bd90d62ea4f8cd01c7bf6f34c0c97a24719", "ja": "そうだな。……ん？\nあそこにいるのは、今日の出演者だな。", "zh": "是啊……嗯？\n在那里的，是今天的出演者吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "1a212080e3841a23d67651170527415f73393443eea943f88ef157537d7fdebb", "ja": "あっ、本当です！\nありさだけですが、ひとまずご挨拶を……。", "zh": "啊，真的耶！\n虽然只有亚利沙一个人，不过我先去打个招呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c2e7595ae5c58e493e36cede2c4dc99af98826e8d419c47d73c7adef7a3a2a80", "ja": "ちょっと待て、亜利沙。……", "zh": "等等，亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1013_taibana", "source_sha256": "59a1d0c8f1a17fe3af0ea0b45808f603bbf3743d2376d045a5fd42c10c8ac36e", "ja": "なんか今日、すごい混みそうじゃない？\nあのアイドルの子達のファンで……。", "zh": "感觉今天好像会特别拥挤呢？\n都是那群偶像的粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1014_taibanb", "source_sha256": "302d55a516e4277ba18033d80fef5e8f9097a444ab8bfdcc81e3b4905e3bd390", "ja": "デモ聞いたけど、下手っていうかガチの初心者じゃん。\nあれでライブハウスとか出る？", "zh": "我听过试听了，你这与其说是水平差，根本就是个彻头彻尾的新手嘛。这样也能去Live House演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1015_taibana", "source_sha256": "048545af84c494ff08b3ae952c6d8e74667725fefda505f8fee83e4786141d48", "ja": "まあアイドルだから、客も演奏の腕とか、\nどうでもいいんだろうけどさー。", "zh": "反正都是偶像了，观众对演奏水平什么的，\n大概也根本不在乎吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1016_taibanb", "source_sha256": "38fcbc91dad149df3f7064b3c56abb77ec92ad9c123dec1e46ed32dc85105bc4", "ja": "あははっ！", "zh": "啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "03d25be61f6ab687954403e92505f783ac16f269833b1d25d7fe13d379bf73f2", "ja": "（しまった……。\n聞かないほうがいい悪口を聞いてしまったな）", "zh": "（糟了……听到了不该听的坏话）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c247c350b7a7fa61d46756e17aef427654f3943d55bcfebf268d71bbe77cc86a", "ja": "亜利沙、裏口から帰ろう。", "zh": "亚利沙，我们从后门回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "18133fbd42f7b1caedb216ecabee0e10226e675462d31983ede38dcde6bb3d43", "ja": "た、ただいまかえりましたぁっ！\n恵美ちゃん可奈ちゃん、お待たせしましたっ！", "zh": "我、我回来啦！\n惠美，可奈，让你们久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "2403b674b895ee6f1e2e804ef3de177e0885a868d9b4698b987213805e8f378d", "ja": "あっ、亜利沙さん、おかえりなさい！\n……あの、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，亚利沙姐，欢迎回来！\n……那个，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "04721b68e27c95ba8e8db8a12d6a27dc3a4fa32708171bd6900bb0c78dd1c194", "ja": "えっ、ななな何がですか！！？", "zh": "诶，什什什什么事啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a5e7c5de6f4d260342b47a73ea0a752a406f0ca43a7984dd2f13c68299a0dc4", "ja": "だって、なんだか顔が……\n恵美さんも、そう思いませんか？", "zh": "因为，总觉得你的表情……\n惠美，你不也这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "29846c1ba5a7742cb568d47d47d58a2872ef30584149c08fd7894ae5692add98", "ja": "んー、なになに？\n亜利沙、アタシのコトよ～く見て！", "zh": "嗯——怎么啦怎么啦？\n亚利沙，好好看看我的脸哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "75a52acd29a96424d6672a377601867dbed5a1a588ae172d884d1f44549a8950", "ja": "ヒェッ！？　あああ、ありさが恵美ちゃんのお顔を\n至近距離からじっと見つめるとか、恐れ多い……！", "zh": "呜哇！？啊啊啊，亚利沙居然要从这么近的距离一直盯着惠美的脸看，这也太僭越了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "3769d7025130890e79d2907538a7ecaca1fd6e118b824691a8d4afbc912ea481", "ja": "あ、ホントだ。\n亜利沙、コンビニで何かあった？", "zh": "啊，真的耶。\n亚利沙，你在便利店遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "0bb7827abe1447f29a0dd90d3f804fdf8566964c6427836a33ec891f72b72cf9", "ja": "ギクゥッ！？\nど、どうしてわかっちゃうんですかぁ！？", "zh": "咯噔！？  \n您、您是怎么发现的呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "ab1373dd2269ca0a9f051d694d20d92164fee43c6007305dd5a57ffb9a90b585", "ja": "やっぱり！　アイドルが見ていいって言ってるのに、\n亜利沙が食いつかないなんておかしいもん！", "zh": "果然！偶像都说可以看了，亚利沙却一点都不感兴趣，肯定很奇怪嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "cc4f418f51c41084e7b50785296f60a497f2c73982782dc82df1dd6123ef6dba", "ja": "思わぬところでバレバレだったな……。\n亜利沙、みんなに話してみてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "在完全意想不到的地方彻底穿帮了啊……\n亚利沙，跟大家聊聊看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "bfa40a79393f5ba4bb233580aedb191e1de493c9fc3090606698bc2e14146518", "ja": "あまりいい話じゃないけど、だからといって\n亜利沙ひとりで抱えるものでもないと思うよ。", "zh": "虽然不是什么好事，但也不该让亚利沙一个人扛着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "7dc2310b3217beb85c5d5b167718549126fe1bfe3cc9cc0b00e7bc9f70ee6004", "ja": "{$P$}さん……はい。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "44c3fd72630558593680529e204ef5a1359bce58f0eec63b89db178d9aba8e77", "ja": "あの……コンビニから出たら、今日の対バン相手の人が\nいて。ありさ、挨拶しようと思ったんですケド……。", "zh": "那个……从便利店出来后，遇到了今天一起演出的对方。\n亚利沙本来想去打个招呼，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb2952df333e2b6c3fb6719c7f339c3446597bad4c81879dcb17cd7488e3db71", "ja": "下手っていうか、初心者じゃんって……お客さんも、\n演奏の腕とかどうでもいいんだろう、って言われてて。", "zh": "被人说“与其说是演奏得差，不如说就是个新手吧……观众大概也根本不在乎演奏水平之类的”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "920538156551eee2642c366fc22ba81234f0893251ce45d9635d6b4da7929c00", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言われちゃってたんですか！？\n私たちはともかく、お客さんを悪く言うなんて……。", "zh": "竟、竟然被人说了这种话吗！？\n先不说我们，居然还要说观众的坏话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "3ffef4826a956d2d00e6154687dc7660268760b79d31d933d469ca8c80522a57", "ja": "アタシたちのコト、何も知らないんだもんね。\nそういう感想になるのも、当然なのかな……。", "zh": "毕竟他们对我们一无所知嘛。\n会有那样的感想，也是理所当然的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "93a8a30cd14319c0d692d04a11baafb1b07974102e8612a407ca749a4fc0a1ba", "ja": "一生懸命、練習したのに……\nそれだけじゃ、ダメだったのかな～……。", "zh": "明明已经拼命练习了……\n难道光是这样还不够吗～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ee0c6aa12152455c32ec435e32d1ba767f9a3051a3b978b302374a198777c42a", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。", "zh": "才不是那回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3c5d68e9390f13aed547217c7ddcbd784eaebabb2bf4cd9d47058155eb942bee", "ja": "今日3人を観にくる人達は、普段は\n劇場のお客さんだろう。それは間違いない。", "zh": "今天来看演出的3人，平时应该都是剧场的观众。这一点毫无疑问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4fba6853fb79b871fe02de5a4fb4a07548e41d097466a538842fb50e96cf4557", "ja": "皆、頑張っているアイドルの姿が好きだから、バンドで\n輝いている姿を見たいと思って、来てくれるんだ。", "zh": "因为大家都喜欢偶像们努力的模样，想看看她们在乐队中闪耀的样子，所以才会来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1042_p", "source_sha256": "45c7a8464e0758a39286c1ff97a5a35bea997f347d511675756a96d7d9993d72", "ja": "そんな人達が……本当に、\n演奏をどうでもいいと思ってるかな。", "zh": "那些人……真的会觉得演奏无所谓吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "7bf4d67bbb27cb37ff3501dc79c9591e8995bab30a4193ee9d9609a87c438803", "ja": "{$P$}……うん。そうだね！\n知らない人が何て言おうと、アタシたちはがんばった！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯。是啊！不管陌生人说什么，我们都努力过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "796953d964ccdc7a609bd4c344fa6d8d580625865e96b2feb487441fffa2ea37", "ja": "そのことは、{$P$}が知ってる。\nメンバーだけじゃない、ジュリアや静香だって……。", "zh": "这件事，{$P$}知道。\n不只是成员们，茱莉亚和静香也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "b12971350f0ff9b708a5f0b0cc3c3ff3e124e05a06ee9aedc006f35f74f19cae", "ja": "アタシたちを応援してくれるお客さんたちのためにも！\n今日は思いっきり、ぶつかって行こっ！", "zh": "为了支持我们的客人们！\n今天就放开手脚，全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1046_p", "source_sha256": "b2132636ce920ab37ac6d753404556670ed077f6766e0d798fa9485cb9bdb3e6", "ja": "そうだな。……陰口は気にせず、あとは\n精一杯のパフォーマンスを見てもらうしかない。", "zh": "是啊。……别在意那些背后的闲话，接下来只能拿出全部实力，让他们看看我们的表现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "e9a5b561d57057da0918ae08159acee6050830db5fc48df40e85d3b03e840222", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！\n矢吹可奈、気合いを入れてがんばりまーす♪", "zh": "好的，我明白了！\n矢吹可奈会打起精神努力的——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "3b27ea9b64054e60977fcf2bb746f283b585c37b33ef308f8dede90fd681d16f", "ja": "ありさも、みんなに見てもらいたいですっ！", "zh": "亚利沙也想让大家看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0172_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_06_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "002901793b3cb9db3fa233b5b07214539da063dedec2a21950a1351c04f08e1d", "ja": "亜利沙、可奈！　今日はみんなに、アイドルの\nカッコいいとこ、いっぱい見せつけてやろーねっ♪", "zh": "亚利纱、可奈！今天要让大家好好看看偶像帅气的一面哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
